	    quid       	"3A10F4C4017D"
	    documentation 	
|The CTensor class uses the tensor notation  with the components xx yy zz xy xz yz. The CTensor class uses an compression mechanism using the following properties
|xx = value1
|yy = value2
|zz = value3
|xy = 0.0
|xz = 0.0
|yz = 0.0
|
|in this case only value 1, 2 and 3 are stored and the case
|
|xx = value
|yy = value
|zz = value
|xy = 0.0
|xz = 0.0
|yz = 0.0
|
|only value is stored.
	    
